<title>ETHIOPIA: SOCCER-ETHIOPIA AND EGYPT DRAW 1-1 IN AFRICA NATIONS CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ETHIOPIA AND EGYPT DRAW 1-1 IN AFRICA NATIONS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>ADDIS ABABA 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ethiopia and Egypt drew 1-1 (halftime 0-0) in their African Nations Cup soccer tournament group three qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Ethiopia - Aseyed Tesfaye 58</p>
<p>Egypt - Akram Abdulmajid 71</p>
<p>Attendance: 25,000.</p>
</text>
